  <name>Flibustier</name>
  <summary>Open source engine re-implementation of Pirates! Gold</summary>
  <developer id="org.flibustier">
    <name>Olivier Cochard-Labbé</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Flibustier is a clean-room, open source engine for Pirates! Gold: sail
      the Caribbean, trade, fight ships and duel their captains, raid towns
      and seek fame and fortune.
    </p>
    <p>
      It comes with an open pack of art, sound and game data, and plays with
      no original game files. Players who own the GOG release can point it
      at their own copy instead.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.flibustier.Flibustier.desktop</launchable>
